@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Create an event (each send creates a new MongoDB document)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "AI & Future Technologies Workshop",
  "description": "Workshop about artificial intelligence and future technologies.",
  "date": "2026-10-25",
  "time": "10:00 AM - 12:00 PM",
  "location": "Main Auditorium",
  "image": "/images/event1.png",
  "category": "Workshop"
}

### Retrieve all events, sorted by date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events
Accept: application/json
